# 201 — Agent Organization

## Bootstrap (with 200-runtime-platform)

1. `.ai/AGENTS.md` — **Team OS v1.0 entry**
2. `.ai/KNOWLEDGE_MANAGEMENT.md` — truth classes
3. `.ai/MULTI_AGENT_COORDINATION.md` — if parallel agents possible
4. `.ai/roles/<role>.md` + `.ai/workflows/<type>.md`
5. `.ai/brain/PROJECT_BRAIN.md` — company mind (deep)
6. `.ai/runtime/WORKFLOW_ENGINE.md` — deep pipeline (frozen, optional)

## WHO not HOW

| Layer | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Team OS | `.ai/AGENTS.md` · core systems · `roles/` · `workflows/` · `standards/` |
| Mind | `.ai/brain/` |
| Agents | `.ai/roles/*.md` · `.ai/agents/*.md` (legacy deep) |
| Process | `.ai/runtime/` (frozen) |

## Every PR

- Quality Index: `.ai/brain/QUALITY_INDEX.md`
- AI Metrics block: `.ai/AI_METRICS.md`
- QA Director ship veto · Security review on auth paths

## Do not

- Edit POS/Constitution without human
- Skip agent hat reviews on user-facing changes
- Merge to main (human only)

